# Netlify custom headers (https://docs.netlify.com/routing/headers/).
# Each rule is a path line followed by indented "Header: value" lines. The
# path must come first — without it Netlify rejects the block.
#
# CSP allow-list notes:
#   js.hs-*/usemessages.com  HubSpot tracker, injected at runtime by the GTM
#                            container; the hs-scripts loader then pulls the
#                            analytics/forms/banner scripts itself.
#   app.netlify.com          Netlify deploy-preview drawer iframe.
#   cdn.jsdelivr.net         IBM Plex Sans woff2 files fetched by the LikeC4
#                            web component's injected @font-face rules.
#   raw.githubusercontent.com  LF AI project logos referenced from blog posts.
/*
